mission "The Company Beneath the Sand"
    name "The Company Beneath the Sand"
    description "Uncover the modern syndicate financing the search and free its imprisoned mapmaker."
    source "Redoubt"
    destination "Sugarhook"
    reward 1915
    speaker offer "Mapmaker Jules Ardent"
    speaker visit "Mapmaker Jules Ardent"
    speaker complete "Mapmaker Jules Ardent"
    to offer
        has "The Captain's Other Journal: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Uncover the modern syndicate financing the search and free its imprisoned mapmaker.`
            `Mapmaker Jules Ardent studies you for a moment. "The old sea charter settled one war, but it did not settle the past. The lost expedition sailed west under a sealed order, and its wake is stirring every ambitious captain in these waters."
            choice
                `(I will help uncover what happened.)`
                    accept
                `(Tell me what you are not saying.)`
                    goto details
                `(I have no wish to be drawn into another quarrel.)`
                    close
            label details
                `Mapmaker Jules Ardent lowers their voice. "The maps were altered, the convoy erased from the books, and someone has been buying witnesses. Follow the evidence, not the flags."`
                choice
                    `(Then I will take the matter in hand.)`
                        accept
                    `(Not today.)`
                        close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Company Beneath the Sand. Uncover the modern syndicate financing the search and free its imprisoned mapmaker."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Mapmaker Jules Ardent receives you at Sugarhook. The evidence fits another piece into the puzzle: the expedition was not searching for gold alone, but for a place deliberately removed from every official chart.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Mapmaker Jules Ardent thanks you. "Every answer makes the sea less simple, captain. Yet the truth belongs to the people who live here, not to the first crown or company that can put a seal upon it."`
        log "Completed The Company Beneath the Sand. Received 1915 gold. Uncover the modern syndicate financing the search and free its imprisoned mapmaker."
